  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You master your body’s response to stressful conditions.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Body Control<sup>WK</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As long as you have at least 1 point in your ki pool, you gain the benefit of endure elements, or mythic endure elements if you expend one use of your mythic power. When you hold your breath, add your mythic tier to the number of rounds (or minutes, if you expend one use of your ki pool) that you can hold your breath. While holding your breath, you gain immunity to non-mythic drowning, suffocation, and inhaled effects and add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) to your saving throw bonus against gas, mist, and mythic drowning, suffocation, and inhaled effects.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-ki-feats#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
